      "message": "test(plasma): pin the cover law's tightened tolerance; one tol for both laws\n\nReview item on #1081: cover_law could be handed the plain KERF_TOL\nwith every test green. The cut now reads p.kerf_tol() once and hands\nthe same figure to the kerf law's band and the cover law's reach, and\nplasma::tests::the_cover_law_reads_the_tightened_tolerance_on_a_coarse_model\nputs an edge between the two reaches: covered at full fidelity,\nrefused by name on a coarse model.\n\nRefs #1053\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
